abstract: >-
  A searchable database of classical Ayurvedic medicines for students and practitioners.
  This project aims to create a standardized, machine-readable dataset of Ayurvedic formulations
  derived from authoritative texts like the Ayurvedic Formulary of India (AFI),
  Bhavaprakasha Nighantu, and Sharngadhara Samhita.
